@host = http://localhost:5157
@apiKey = change-me-local-dev-key
@documentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Upload document
POST {{host}}/api/documents/upload
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello from the Document Q&A API sample.
------boundary--

### Ask a question
POST {{host}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/ask
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is this document about?"
}

### Get Q&A history
GET {{host}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/history
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
